WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.628
Counseling.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.782
From a Marine’s page, record the counseling:

3
00:00:06.782 --> 00:00:11.647
what went well, what to improve, and the goals you set.

4
00:00:12.197 --> 00:00:15.573
Save it, and it is on their record,

5
00:00:15.573 --> 00:00:18.891
dated, with you as the counselor.

6
00:00:19.441 --> 00:00:23.139
They open it from Career, and acknowledge it.

7
00:00:23.139 --> 00:00:27.360
That confirms they read it, not that they agree.

8
00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:31.262
Both of you hold the same dated record,

9
00:00:31.262 --> 00:00:33.956
and it shows as acknowledged.
